{"comment_text": {"ja42:0.1": "", "ja42:0.2": "", "ja42:0.3": "", "ja42:0.4": "", "ja42:1.1": "A greedy crow, ignoring the warning of the wise pigeon, continues to steal food from the kitchen. ", "ja42:1.2": "", "ja42:1.3": "", "ja42:1.4": "", "ja42:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja42:0.1": "<article id='ja42'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja42:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja42:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja42:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja42:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja42:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja42:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja42:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja42:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja42:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja42:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja42:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja42:0.4": "2. Kapotajātaka ", "ja42:1.1": "“Yo atthakāmassa hitānukampino, ", "ja42:1.2": "Ovajjamāno na karoti sāsanaṁ; ", "ja42:1.3": "Kapotakassa vacanaṁ akatvā, ", "ja42:1.4": "Amittahatthatthagatova setī”ti. ", "ja42:2.1": "Kapotajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja42:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 42 ", "ja42:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja42:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja42:0.4": "The Pigeon: a past life story ", "ja42:1.1": "One who does not follow advice when instructed ", "ja42:1.2": "by an ally who wants to help, ", "ja42:1.3": "not following the pigeon’s counsel, ", "ja42:1.4": "ends up in the hands of their foes. ", "ja42:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja42:0.1": "", "ja42:0.2": "", "ja42:0.3": "", "ja42:0.4": "", "ja42:1.1": "", "ja42:1.2": "", "ja42:1.3": "", "ja42:1.4": "", "ja42:2.1": "Kapotajātakaṁ → kapotakajātakaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) "}, "reference_text": {"ja42:0.1": "", "ja42:0.2": "", "ja42:0.3": "", "ja42:0.4": "", "ja42:1.1": "csp1ed22.11, csp2ed22.11, ms22J_92, msdiv42, ndp22.12, pts-vp-pli1.244", "ja42:1.2": "", "ja42:1.3": "", "ja42:1.4": "", "ja42:2.1": "ms22J_93"}, "keys_order": ["ja42:0.1", "ja42:0.2", "ja42:0.3", "ja42:0.4", "ja42:1.1", "ja42:1.2", "ja42:1.3", "ja42:1.4", "ja42:2.1"]}